<title>TAIWAN: BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN TAIWAN OPEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RESULTS OF FINALS IN TAIWAN OPEN CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals in the Taiwan Open badminton championships on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>5/8-Peter Gade Christensen (Denmark) beat 2-Poul-Erik Hoyer Larsen (Denmark) 15-10 18-15</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>2-Camilla Martin (Denmark) beat 1-Mia Audina (Indonesia) 12-10 11-2</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>3/4-Chandra Wijaya/Sigit (Indonesia) beat 2-Denny Kantono/Antonius S (Indonesia) 15-10 15-2</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Yim Kyung-jin/Park Soo-yun (South Korea) beat Yoshiko Iwata/Haruko Matsuda (Japan) 15-12 15-8</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>3/4-Sandiarto/Finarsih (Indonesia) beat 3/4-Lee Dong-soo/Park Soo-yun (South Korea) 15-11 15-8</p>
</text>
